    <description>
        Nav2 5-Zone Benchmark Test Map (30m x 20m Flawless U-Shape)
        Zone 1: Normal Nav2 & S-Curve Avoidance (13m x 5m)
        Zone 2: Dynamic Obstacle Crossing (12m x 5m)
        Zone 3: 1st 90-deg Right-angle Turn (+Y direction, 5m x 11.6m)
        Zone 4: 2nd 90-deg Turn & Large Open Space (-X direction, 18m x 8.4m, LiDAR Feature Starvation)
        Zone 5: Relocalization & Straight-path Obstacles (12m x 5m)
    </description>
</model>
